<title>PORTUGAL: Trade in Lisnave interrupted - dealers.</title>
<headline>Trade in Lisnave interrupted - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares of loss-making Portuguese ship repairer Lisnave was interrupted on Lisbon bourse, dealers said.  </p>
<p>Bourse sources said the interruption was due to an interview that the president of Lisnave, Jose de Mello, gave to a public TV station. No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
